                               new_page, dma, pkt_size, 0);

- Submit buffer as an RX descriptor to hardware DMA engine.
- DMA will fill this page with next packet.

If failed:
    WARN_ON(ret == -ENOMEM);
    page_pool_recycle_direct(pool, new_page);

- Full DMA ring or unexpected error.
- Recycle page safely.


